            + "2) [STEP-BY-STEP ANALYTICAL DERIVATION]:\n"
            + "   • Step 1 (Discriminant): Δ = b^2 - 4ac = (" + str(qb) + ")^2 - 4(" + str(qa) + ")(" + str(q_c) + ") = " + str(disc) + ".\n"
            + "   • Step 2 (Quadratic Formula): r = (-b ± sqrt(Δ)) / (2a) -> r1 = " + str(r1) + ", r2 = " + str(r2) + ".\n"
            + "3) [FORMAL VIETA INVARIANT PROOF]: Sum of roots r1 + r2 = " + str(r1 + r2) + " == -b/a, and product of roots r1 * r2 = " + str(r1 * r2) + " == c/a.\n"
            + "4) [EXECUTABLE PURE-PBLANG VERIFICATION]: `solve_quadratic_roots(a, b, c)` computes Δ, roots, and Vieta invariants below.";
