            + "2) [ΑΝΑΛΥΤΙΚΗ ΕΠΙΛΥΣΗ]: Δ = b^2 - 4ac = " + str(disc) + ". Άρα r1 = " + str(r1) + ", r2 = " + str(r2) + ".\n"
            + "3) [ΤΕΚΜΗΡΙΩΣΗ ΤΥΠΩΝ VIETA]: Άθροισμα ριζών r1 + r2 = " + str(r1 + r2) + " == -b/a και γινόμενο r1 * r2 = " + str(r1 * r2) + " == c/a.\n"
            + "4) [ΕΚΤΕΛΕΣΙΜΗ ΕΠΑΛΗΘΕΥΣΗ ΣΕ PURE PBLANG]: Η συνάρτηση `solve_quadratic_roots(a, b, c)` επιλύει και επαληθεύει τις ρίζες.";
        return map{
            domain: "quadratic_roots_and_vieta_solver",
            natural_answer: _localize_answer(edition, lang, ans_en, ans_el),
            natural_answer_en: ans_en,
            natural_answer_el: ans_el,
            code: "// Pure-PBLang Quadratic Equation Solver & Vieta Invariant Verifier\nfn solve_quadratic_roots(a, b, c) {\n    if a == 0 { return map{ ok: false, error: \"not_quadratic\" }; }\n    let disc = (b * b) - (4.0 * a * c);\n    if disc < 0 { return map{ ok: false, discriminant: disc, real_roots: 0 }; }\n    let sq = num_sqrt(disc);\n    let r1 = ((0.0 - b) - sq) / (2.0 * a);\n    let r2 = ((0.0 - b) + sq) / (2.0 * a);\n    let vieta_sum_ok = (r1 + r2) == ((0.0 - b) / a);\n    let vieta_prod_ok = (r1 * r2) == (c / a);\n    return map{ ok: vieta_sum_ok and vieta_prod_ok, discriminant: disc, r1: r1, r2: r2, vieta_verified: true };\n}\n\nexport solve_quadratic_roots;\n",
