            + "   • Step 2 (Dimensional SI conversion): Since 1 km = 1,000 m and 1 h = 3,600 s, divide by 3.6 -> v_SI = " + str(v_kmh) + " / 3.6 = " + str(v_ms) + " m/s.\n"
            + "3) [FORMAL DIMENSIONAL PROOF]: Reconstructing distance from SI velocity: v_SI * (time_h * 3600 s) = " + str(v_ms) + " * " + str(time_h * 3600.0) + " m = " + str(dist_km) + " km.\n"
