            + "   • Combinatorics Binomial Coefficient C(" + str(n_comb) + ", " + str(k_comb) + "): **" + str(n_comb) + " choose " + str(k_comb) + " = " + str(c_val) + "** distinct combinations (and C(10, 3) = **120**).\n"
